<title>SPAIN: Spain had April budget cash surplus of 407 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain had April budget cash surplus of 407 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish budget secretary Jose Folgado said on Tuesday that in April Spain had a state budget surplus on a cash basis of 407.0 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>This was 45.8 percent higher than the year ago period, he said.</p>
</text>
